    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "BRANIFF InTERnATIOnAL\nU.S. MAINLAND HAWAII MEHICO SOUTH AMERICA\nYou'll like flying.\nBI\n•.....D..\nBraniff Style.\nBRANIFF INTERNRTIONRL\nSummer/Fall 1971",
      "Braniff flies the good times\nbetween Dallas/Fort Worth\nand LaGuardia\nDallas/Fort Worth to LaGuardia, 8:45 A.M., 12:15 Noon, 5:30 P.M.\n9:00 A.M., 2:15 P.M., 5:30 P.M\nLne good toes star rt ranite 8:45 a.m. nop-stop. is the most convenient early morning flight\nfrom Dallas/Fort Worth to LaGuardia, Manhattan's close-in airport. And at 5:30 p.m., you can\ntake advantage of our late-afternoon non-stop to LaGuardia after a full day's business. We give you good\ntimes back to Dallas/Fort Worth, too.\nPhone Braniff. We'll put you up in style to Kennedy or Newark airport if you prefer. We'll get you a con-\nfirmed reservation in five seconds. And arrange a room or rental car, too. It's all part of flying Branitf Style.\n12005.132.010.039",
      "Seattle/Tacoma\nPortland\na San Francisco/Oakland\n• Los Angeles\nScheduled Services\nRoute Map\nMinneapolis/St. Paul\nBoston\nDetroit\nI Buffalo\nNew York/Newark\nDes Moines\n• Cleveland\nChicago\nOmaha\nDenver\nWashington\nKansas City\nSt. Louis\nColorado Springs\nOklahoma\n- City\n1 Nashville\nAmarillo\nFort\n•Little Rock\nMemphis\n• Atlanta\nSmith 4\nLubbock Vichita Falst Shreveport\nDallas/Fort Worth\nAustin\nSan Antonio\n*New Orleans\nHouston C\nB. Tampa/St. Petersburg/Clearwater\nCorpus Christi\n• Brownsville\nMiami/Fort Lauderdale\nMexico City\nAcapulco\nTo Honolulu • To Hilo\nColon\nPanama City/\nBalboa\n• Medelin\nBogota\nCali\nQuito\nGuayaquil\nCaracas\nRecife\nLima\nBRANIFF INTERNATIONAL\nU.S. MAINLAND HAWAII MEXICO SOUTH AMERICA\n• La Paz\nI Cochabamba\n• Brasilia\n• Belo Horizonte\n•I Antofagasta\n• Rio de Janeiro\nSao Paulo\nAsuncion\n• Porto Alegre\n• Cordoba\nValparaiso\nSantiago\n• Concepcion\nRosario\n• Montevideo\nBuenos Aires"
